# sweep: --bare
# A typed search lists matches, can be saved, and the saved search reruns
# from Saved after a restart.
wait-for Preprints
tap Saved
wait-for Nothing saved
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Search arXiv
wait-for Type here
type xstack
tap Search
wait-idle 20000
wait-for XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration
expect Save this search
expect Any time
clean
shot search-results
tap Save this search
wait-idle
expect-missing Save this search
tap Back
wait-idle
restart
wait-for Preprints
tap Saved
wait-for Saved search
expect xstack
clean
shot saved-search
tap xstack
wait-idle 20000
wait-for XStack: A Benchmark
expect-missing Save this search
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Saved
wait-for Saved search
tap Manage
wait-for Done
tap xstack
wait-for Nothing saved
tap Back
wait-idle
# A date shown to a person reads as a date, not a database stamp.
tap Search arXiv
wait-for Type here
type xstack
tap Search
wait-idle 20000
wait-for XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration
expect-missing 2026-11-05
